#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected evidence does not establish an exact route. It describes a coastal way, while this overview is schematic rather than a measured itinerary."
msgstr "Ushahidi uliochaguliwa hauthibitishi njia sahihi. Unaeleza njia ya pwani, wakati muhtasari huu ni wa mchoro tu na si ramani iliyopimwa ya safari."

#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "They hired a skilled guide, entrusted him with two riding animals, and arranged to meet him at Thawr. The account says he led them by the coastal way."
msgstr "Walikodi kiongozi wa njia mwenye ujuzi, wakamkabidhi wanyama wawili wa kupanda, na wakapanga kukutana naye huko Thawr. Simulizi inasema aliwaongoza kupitia njia ya pwani."

#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected account says that they remained in the cave for three nights."
msgstr "Simulizi iliyochaguliwa inasema kwamba walibaki pangoni kwa masiku matatu."

#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "The preparations account describes provisions packed in a bag and Asma bint Abi Bakr using part of her waist-belt to tie its opening."
msgstr "Simulizi ya maandalizi inaeleza chakula kilichowekwa kwenye mfuko na Asma bint Abi Bakr akitumia sehemu ya mshipi wake kufunga mdomo wa mfuko huo."

#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "The arrival account describes Muslims waiting, the stay among Bani ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf, and later building work at the mosque site."
msgstr "Simulizi ya kuwasili inaeleza Waislamu waliokuwa wakisubiri, kukaa kwao miongoni mwa Bani ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf, na baadaye kazi ya ujenzi katika eneo la msikiti."

#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected evidence does not establish an answer to that question. The available source records are shown below."
msgstr "Ushahidi uliochaguliwa hauthibitishi jibu la swali hilo. Kumbukumbu za vyanzo vilivyopo zinaonyeshwa hapa chini."

