#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "A rider on the road"
msgstr "Mpanda farasi njiani"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Quraysh had offered a reward for each of the two travellers. Suraqah ibn Malik recounts that a man came to his gathering and said he had just seen figures near the coast. Suraqah recognised who they must be, and set out after them."
msgstr "Maquraishi walikuwa wametoa zawadi kwa kila mmoja wa wasafiri hao wawili. Suraqah ibn Malik anasimulia kwamba mtu mmoja alikuja kwenye mkusanyiko wake na kusema kwamba alikuwa ametoka tu kuona watu karibu na pwani. Suraqah alitambua walikuwa nani, na akaondoka kuwafuata."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "By his own account, he came close enough to hear the Prophet ﷺ reciting. Then the forelegs of his horse sank into the ground up to the knees, and he was thrown from it."
msgstr "Kwa mujibu wa simulizi yake mwenyewe, alikaribia vya kutosha kumsikia Mtume ﷺ akisoma. Kisha miguu ya mbele ya farasi wake ilizama ardhini hadi magotini, naye akaanguka kutoka kwake."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "He told them what Quraysh intended and offered them provisions. They took nothing from him and asked only that he keep their news hidden. At his request, ‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah wrote him a guarantee of safety on a piece of leather. Then they went on."
msgstr "Aliwaambia kile ambacho Maquraishi walikusudia na akawatolea vifaa vya safari. Hawakuchukua kitu chochote kutoka kwake na waliomba tu kwamba afiche habari zao. Kwa ombi lake, ‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah alimwandikia barua ya amana ya usalama kwenye kipande cha ngozi. Kisha wakaendelea na safari."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Quba: the first stop"
msgstr "Quba: kituo cha kwanza"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "He stayed among them for more than ten nights. There he founded the mosque that the account calls the one founded on piety, and he prayed in it."
msgstr "Alikaa miongoni mwao kwa zaidi ya masiku kumi. Hapo alianzisha msikiti ambao simulizi inauita ule ulioanzishwa juu ya ucha Mungu, na akaswali ndani yake."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Then he rode on, with people walking beside him, until his camel knelt at a place in Madinah where some of the Muslims already prayed. It was a yard for drying dates."
msgstr "Kisha akapanda mnyama na kuendelea na safari, huku watu wakitembea kando yake, hadi ngamia wake alipopiga magoti mahali fulani huko Madinah ambapo baadhi ya Waislamu walikuwa tayari wakiswali. Palikuwa ni uwanja wa kukaushia tende."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Suraqah’s account records the reward offered for each of the two, and a report that figures had been seen near the coast."
msgstr "Simulizi ya Suraqah inaeleza zawadi iliyotolewa kwa kila mmoja wao, na ripoti kwamba watu walikuwa wameonekana karibu na pwani."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "It does not establish where on the route this happened, and the scene does not place it."
msgstr "Haionyeshi ni wapi hasa katika njia hii jambo hili lilitokea, na mandhari haionyeshi eneo hilo."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Suraqah describes the forelegs of his horse sinking into the ground to the knees, and being thrown."
msgstr "Suraqah anaeleza jinsi miguu ya mbele ya farasi wake ilivyozama ardhini hadi magotini, na yeye kuangushwa chini."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "This is his own first-person account. The scene shows the road, not the event or any person."
msgstr "Huu ni ushuhuda wake mwenyewe wa nafsi ya kwanza. Mandhari inaonyesha njia, si tukio lenyewe wala mtu yeyote."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "They asked only that he keep their news hidden; ‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah wrote him a guarantee of safety."
msgstr "Waliomba tu kwamba afiche habari zao; ‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah akamwandikia barua ya amana ya usalama."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The wording of the written guarantee is not given in this passage."
msgstr "Maneno ya barua hiyo ya amana ya usalama hayajatajwa katika kifungu hiki."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The account gives a stay of more than ten nights among Bani ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf and the founding of a mosque there."
msgstr "Simulizi inataja kukaa kwa zaidi ya usiku kumi miongoni mwa Bani ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf na kuanzishwa kwa msikiti hapo."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "He rode on with people walking beside him until his camel knelt at the site of the mosque in Madinah."
msgstr "Alipanda mnyama huku watu wakitembea kando yake hadi ngamia wake alipopiga magoti kwenye eneo la msikiti huko Madinah."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "It does not establish the route taken through the town or the appearance of the place."
msgstr "Haionyeshi njia iliyopitwa ndani ya mji au jinsi eneo hilo lilivyokuwa linaonekana."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "<0>Play</0> walks the chapter stage by stage with AI-generated narration."
msgstr "<0>Cheza</0> inakuongoza katika hatua za sura hii hatua kwa hatua kwa masimulizi yaliyozalishwa na AI."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "<0>Play</0> walks the chapter stage by stage. The captions keep time over a quiet wind."
msgstr "<0>Cheza</0> inakuongoza katika hatua za sura hii hatua kwa hatua. Maelezo ya maandishi yanaenda sambamba na sauti ya upepo mtulivu."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
