msgid "<0>Ask</0> uses the chapter’s context to research in Turath and answer with source citations."
msgstr "<0>Uliza</0> inatumia muktadha wa sura hii kufanya utafiti katika Turath na kujibu kwa kutaja vyanzo."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "This excerpt does not give an exact departure date."
msgstr "Dondoo hili halitaji tarehe kamili ya kuondoka."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The excerpt describes preparations, not a nightly delivery to the cave."
msgstr "Dondoo hili linaeleza maandalizi, si uwasilishaji wa usiku kwenye pango."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The excerpt does not describe erasing footprints."
msgstr "Dondoo hili halielezi kufutwa kwa nyayo za miguu."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The account does not describe the cave’s dimensions or layout."
msgstr "Simulizi haielezi vipimo au mpangilio wa pango."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "This excerpt is not the full verse and does not itself name Abu Bakr or Mount Thawr."
msgstr "Dondoo hili si aya nzima na lenyewe halimtaji Abu Bakr wala Mlima Thawr."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "This is Ibn Kathir’s commentary, not the Quranic wording itself."
msgstr "Huu ni ufafanuzi wa Ibn Kathir, si maneno yenyewe ya Quran."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "It does not give an exact location for the stay among Bani ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf."
msgstr "Haitoi eneo kamili la makazi miongoni mwa Bani ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The passage does not name the place; identifying it as Quba rests on other reports."
msgstr "Kifungu hiki hakitaji jina la eneo hilo; kulitambua kama Quba kunategemea ripoti zingine."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The night of departure"
msgstr "Usiku wa kuondoka"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The leaders of Quraysh met in Dar al-Nadwah, the house where they settled their affairs, to decide what to do about the Prophet ﷺ now that they feared him."
msgstr "Viongozi wa Quraysh walikutana Dar al-Nadwah, nyumba waliyokuwa wakiamulia mambo yao, ili kuamua nini cha kufanya kuhusu Mtume ﷺ sasa kwa kuwa walikuwa wakimhofia."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "That night they gathered at his door, waiting for him to sleep. He told ‘Ali to lie in his bed, wrapped in his green cloak, and assured him that no harm from them would reach him."
msgstr "Usiku huo walikusanyika mlangoni kwake, wakimsubiri alale. Akamwambia ‘Ali alale kitandani kwake, akiwa amejifunika joho lake la kijani, na akamhakikishia kuwa hakuna madhara yoyote kutoka kwao yatakayomfikia."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "‘Ali stayed behind for another reason too. People in Makkah left their valuables with the Prophet ﷺ for safekeeping, because they knew his honesty. ‘Ali was to return every one of them."
msgstr "‘Ali alibaki nyuma kwa sababu nyingine pia. Watu wa Makkah walikuwa wakiacha amana zao za thamani kwa Mtume ﷺ ili azitunze, kwa sababu walijua uaminifu wake. ‘Ali alitakiwa kumrudishia kila mmoja wao amana yake."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The tent of Umm Ma‘bad"
msgstr "Hema la Umm Ma‘bad"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Further on they stopped at the tent of Umm Ma‘bad of Khuza‘ah and asked for hospitality. She had no food to offer, she said, and no ewe but one that gave no milk."
msgstr "Mbele zaidi walisimama kwenye hema la Umm Ma‘bad wa kabila la Khuza‘ah na kuomba ukarimu. Alisema hakuwa na chakula cha kuwapa, na hakuwa na kondoo jike isipokuwa mmoja tu ambaye hakuwa akitoa maziwa."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The Prophet ﷺ called for the ewe, passed his hand over its udder and called on Allah. He milked it into a large vessel until it frothed, and said: drink, Umm Ma‘bad. Ibn Kathir notes that her story is well known and comes through routes that strengthen one another."
msgstr "Mtume ﷺ alimwita kondoo huyo, akapitisha mkono wake juu ya kiwele chake na akamwomba Allah. Akamkamua maziwa kwenye chombo kikubwa hadi yakatoa povu, na akasema: kunywa, Umm Ma‘bad. Ibn Kathir anabainisha kuwa kisa chake kinajulikana sana na kinakuja kupitia njia zinazoimarishana zenyewe kwa zenyewe."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Ishaq reports that Quraysh met in Dar al-Nadwah to consult about the Prophet ﷺ once they feared him."
msgstr "Ibn Ishaq anaripoti kuwa Quraysh walikutana Dar al-Nadwah ili kushauriana kuhusu Mtume ﷺ mara tu walipomhofia."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The excerpt covers the meeting, not what was said in it."
msgstr "Dondoo hili linahusu mkutano wenyewe, si yale yaliyosemwa humo."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "They gathered at his door at night; he told ‘Ali to sleep in his bed under his green cloak and assured him of safety."
msgstr "Walikusanyika mlangoni kwake usiku; akamwambia ‘Ali alale kitandani kwake chini ya joho lake la kijani na akamhakikishia usalama."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Kathir notes that al-Waqidi also relates this, combining several narrators’ accounts."
msgstr "Ibn Kathir anabainisha kuwa al-Waqidi pia anasimulia hili, akichanganya masimulizi ya wasimulizi kadhaa."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Ishaq introduces this with “as it has reached me”."
msgstr "Ibn Ishaq anaanza kueleza hili kwa kusema \"kama ilivyonifikia\"."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "They stopped at Umm Ma‘bad’s tent; she had only a ewe without milk, which then gave milk in abundance."
msgstr "Walisimama kwenye hema la Umm Ma‘bad; alikuwa tu na kondoo jike asiye na maziwa, ambaye kisha alitoa maziwa kwa wingi."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Kathir calls the story well known, through routes that support one another. It does not fix where the tent stood."
msgstr "Ibn Kathir analitaja kisa hiki kuwa kinajulikana sana, kupitia njia zinazosaidiana zenyewe kwa zenyewe. Hakitaji wapi hema hilo lilipokuwa limesimama."

#: src/content/details.js
#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Al-Rahiq al-Makhtum"
msgstr "Al-Rahiq al-Makhtum"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "The noon visit"
msgstr "Ziara ya mchana"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "At the height of noon, an hour at which he never used to come, the Prophet ﷺ arrived at Abu Bakr’s house with his face covered. He said he had been given permission to leave. Abu Bakr asked to go with him, and he said yes."
msgstr "Wakati wa mchana wa jua kali, saa ambayo hakuwa na kawaida ya kuja, Mtume ﷺ alifika nyumbani kwa Abu Bakr akiwa amefunika uso wake. Alisema amepewa ruhusa ya kuondoka. Abu Bakr aliomba kuondoka naye, naye akakubali."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "This is ‘Aishah’s account as quoted in a modern sirah. The position of the house is illustrative."
msgstr "Huu ni usimulizi wa 'Aishah kama ulivyonukuliwa katika sirah ya kisasa. Mahali pa nyumba ni kwa ajili ya kuonyesha tu."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Stones in the niche"
msgstr "Mawe kwenye tundu la ukutani"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Abu Bakr took all his money with him, five or six thousand dirhams. Asma recounts that her blind grandfather feared the family had been left with nothing. She put stones where the money used to be kept, covered them with a cloth, and guided his hand to them so that he would be at ease."
msgstr "Abu Bakr alichukua pesa zake zote, dirham elfu tano au sita. Asma anasimulia kwamba babu yake kipofu alihofia kuwa familia imeachwa bila kitu. Aliweka mawe mahali ambapo pesa zilikuwa zikiwekwa, akayafunika kwa nguo, na kuuongoza mkono wake hadi kwenye mawe hayo ili apate utulivu."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Reported by Ibn Ishaq from Asma through her grandson. The position of the house is illustrative."
msgstr "Imeripotiwa na Ibn Ishaq kutoka kwa Asma kupitia mjukuu wake. Mahali pa nyumba ni kwa ajili ya kuonyesha tu."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Why south?"
msgstr "Kwa nini kusini?"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Madinah lies to the north, and that is where a search would begin. They left in the opposite direction, on the road towards Yemen, for about five miles to Mount Thawr."
msgstr "Madinah iko upande wa kaskazini, na huko ndiko utafutaji ungeanzia. Waliondoka kuelekea upande wa pili, kwenye barabara inayoelekea Yemen, kwa takriban maili tano hadi Mlima Thawr."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "This is a modern author’s reading of the route, not wording from an early report."
msgstr "Huku ni kusoma kwa mwandishi wa kisasa kuhusu njia hiyo, si maneno kutoka kwenye ripoti ya mapema."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "She of the two belts"
msgstr "Mwenye mikanda miwili"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "When the three nights had passed, Asma brought their provisions but had forgotten a strap to hang the bag. She undid her waist-belt and used it. For that she was called Dhat al-Nitaqayn, she of the two belts."
msgstr "Zilipopita usiku tatu, Asma alileta chakula chao lakini alikuwa amesahau kamba ya kuning'inizia mfuko. Alifungua mkanda wake wa kiunoni na kuutumia. Kwa ajili hiyo aliitwa Dhat al-Nitaqayn, mwenye mikanda miwili."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Ishaq’s report. ‘Aishah’s account in al-Bukhari places the belt at the packing of the provisions instead."
msgstr "Ripoti ya Ibn Ishaq. Usimulizi wa 'Aishah katika al-Bukhari unaweka mkanda huo wakati wa kufungasha chakula badala yake."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "The spider’s web"
msgstr "Utando wa buibui"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "One report says the pursuers climbed the mountain, passed the cave, and saw a spider’s web across its opening. No one could have gone in, they reasoned, and they moved on. Ibn Kathir calls its chain good, the best of what is reported on this. The scene does not draw the web."
msgstr "Ripoti moja inasema wafuatiliaji walipanda mlima, wakapita pango, na kuona utando wa buibui kwenye mdomo wake. Walisema hakuna mtu ambaye angeingia, na wakaendelea mbele. Ibn Kathir anasema mnyororo wake wa wapokezi ni mzuri, bora zaidi kati ya yale yaliyoripotiwa kuhusu hili. Mandhari haya hayachori utando huo."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "A single report. The nesting doves of popular retellings are not part of it."
msgstr "Ripoti moja tu. Njiwa wanaotaga mayai wa hadithi maarufu si sehemu yake."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "The stations of the road"
msgstr "Vituo vya njiani"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Ishaq names the way the guide took: below Makkah, along the coast, across the road below ‘Usfan, below Amaj, past Qudayd, then al-Kharrar, Thaniyyat al-Marah, Liqf and on. Many of these names are hard to place today, so the line drawn here stays approximate."
msgstr "Ibn Ishaq anataja njia ambayo kiongozi alichukua: chini ya Makkah, kando ya pwani, kuvuka barabara chini ya 'Usfan, chini ya Amaj, kupita Qudayd, kisha al-Kharrar, Thaniyyat al-Marah, Liqf na kuendelea. Majina mengi kati ya haya ni vigumu kuyatafuta leo, kwa hiyo mstari uliorandishwa hapa unabaki wa makadirio tu."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "A list of names, without distances or days."
msgstr "Orodha ya majina, bila umbali au siku."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "White garments"
msgstr "Nguo nyeupe"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "On the way they met al-Zubayr with a group of Muslim merchants returning from Syria. He gave the Prophet ﷺ and Abu Bakr white garments to wear."
msgstr "Njiani walikutana na al-Zubayr akiwa na kundi la wafanyabiashara wa Kiislamu wakirejea kutoka Syria. Alimpa Mtume ﷺ na Abu Bakr nguo nyeupe za kuvaa."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "From al-Bukhari, as quoted by Ibn Kathir. The account does not say where on the road they met."
msgstr "Kutoka al-Bukhari, kama ilivyonukuliwa na Ibn Kathir. Usimulizi huo hausemi ni wapi njiani walipokutana."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "The first Friday"
msgstr "Ijumaa ya kwanza"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "After leaving Quba, the time for Friday prayer came while he was among Banu Salim ibn ‘Awf. He led it there, in the mosque in the bed of the valley, with about a hundred men."
msgstr "Baada ya kuondoka Quba, wakati wa swala ya Ijumaa ulifika akiwa miongoni mwa Banu Salim ibn 'Awf. Aliongoza swala hapo, katika msikiti ulioko kwenye bonde, akiwa na wanaume takriban mia moja."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Quoted from a modern sirah, which cites Ibn Hisham. The position is illustrative."
msgstr "Imenukuliwa kutoka kwenye sirah ya kisasa, ambayo inataja Ibn Hisham. Mahali hapa ni kwa ajili ya kuonyesha tu."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Let her go"
msgstr "Mwacheni aende"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Clan after clan took hold of his camel’s rope and invited him to stay with them. Each time he answered: let her go, for she is under command. She walked on until she knelt in the quarter of Banu Malik ibn al-Najjar."
msgstr "Ukoo baada ya ukoo ulishika kamba ya ngamia wake na kumwalika akae nao. Kila mara alijibu: mwacheni aende, kwani yuko chini ya amri. Alitembea hadi akapiga magoti katika robo ya Banu Malik ibn al-Najjar."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Ishaq’s report. Her path through the town is not known."
msgstr "Ripoti ya Ibn Ishaq. Njia yake kupitia mji haijulikani."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "The house of Abu Ayyub"
msgstr "Nyumba ya Abu Ayyub"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "He stayed in the house of Abu Ayyub until his mosque and his rooms were built, and he worked on the building himself alongside the Muhajirun and the Ansar."
msgstr "Alikaa katika nyumba ya Abu Ayyub hadi msikiti wake na vyumba vyake vilipojengwa, na alifanya kazi ya ujenzi mwenyewe pamoja na Muhajirun na Ansar."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "The house is placed beside the mosque site for illustration."
msgstr "Nyumba imewekwa kando ya eneo la msikiti kwa ajili ya kuonyesha tu."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Brothers"
msgstr "Ndugu"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "He paired those who had migrated with those who received them, as brothers, so that each newcomer had someone to lean on."
msgstr "Aliwaunganisha wale waliohamia na wale waliowapokea, kama ndugu, ili kila mgeni awe na mtu wa kumtegemea."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "This is Ibn Kathir’s chapter heading. The individual pairings are listed in the pages that follow it."
msgstr "Hiki ni kichwa cha sura ya Ibn Kathir. Muunganisho wa mmoja mmoja umeorodheshwa katika kurasa zinazofuata."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "The full moon has risen"
msgstr "Mwezi mpevu umechomoza juu yetu"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "A well-known report says the women and children sang “The full moon has risen upon us, from the passes of al-Wada‘” when he arrived. Al-Bayhaqi relates it from Ibn ‘Aishah, a later narrator, not from someone who was there."
msgstr "Simulizi inayojulikana sana inasema kwamba wanawake na watoto waliimba \"Mwezi mpevu umetuchomozea, kutoka mapito ya al-Wada‘\" alipowasili. Al-Bayhaqi anaipokea kutoka kwa Ibn ‘Aishah, mpokezi wa baadaye, si kutoka kwa mtu aliyekuwepo hapo."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "The chain stops short of an eyewitness, and some place the song at a later return to Madinah, not at this arrival."
msgstr "Mlolongo wa wapokezi unaishia kabla ya kumfikia shuhuda wa macho, na baadhi ya watu wanaweka wimbo huo katika kurejea kwa baadaye huko Madinah, si katika kuwasili huku."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Along the way"
msgstr "Njiani"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Close detail"
msgstr "Funga undani"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Leaving Makkah"
msgstr "Kuondoka Makkah"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Night of 27 Safar · 12–13 September 622"
msgstr "Usiku wa tarehe 27 Safar · 12–13 Septemba 622"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The night of departure is in the accounts. Its place in the calendar is a modern reckoning."
msgstr "Usiku wa kuondoka umo katika simulizi. Nafasi yake katika kalenda ni makadirio ya sasa."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The nights before Friday, Saturday and Sunday"
msgstr "Usiku wa kuamkia Ijumaa, Jumamosi na Jumapili"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Three nights is in al-Bukhari. Naming them after the days of the week follows a modern reckoning."
msgstr "Usiku mitatu imo katika al-Bukhari. Kuzitaja kwa majina ya siku za wiki hufuata makadirio ya sasa."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The guide arrives"
msgstr "Kiongozi anawasili"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Night of Monday, 1 Rabi‘ al-Awwal · 16 September 622"
msgstr "Usiku wa kuamkia Jumatatu, 1 Rabi‘ al-Awwal · 16 Septemba 622"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The guide came with the two mounts after the third night, as arranged. The calendar date is a modern reckoning."
msgstr "Kiongozi alikuja na wanyama wawili wa kupanda baada ya usiku wa tatu, kama ilivyopangwa. Tarehe ya kalenda ni makadirio ya sasa."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "On the coastal road"
msgstr "Kwenye barabara ya pwani"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "About a week"
msgstr "Karibu wiki moja"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The accounts give the order of what happened on the road, but no days. The pursuit and the tent of Umm Ma‘bad fall somewhere in this week."
msgstr "Simulizi zinatoa mpangilio wa yaliyotokea njiani, lakini hakuna siku zilizotajwa. Kufuatwa njiani na hema la Umm Ma‘bad vilitokea wakati fulani katika wiki hii."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Arrival at Quba"
msgstr "Kuwasili Quba"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Monday · 8 Rabi‘ al-Awwal · 23 September 622"
msgstr "Jumatatu · 8 Rabi‘ al-Awwal · 23 Septemba 622"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The account in al-Bukhari says it was a Monday in Rabi‘ al-Awwal. The day of the month is a modern reckoning."
msgstr "Simulizi katika al-Bukhari inasema ilikuwa Jumatatu katika mwezi wa Rabi‘ al-Awwal. Tarehe ya mwezi huo ni makadirio ya kisasa."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The stay at Quba"
msgstr "Kukaa Quba"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Four days, or more than ten nights"
msgstr "Siku nne, au zaidi ya usiku kumi"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Ishaq gives Monday to Thursday. The report in al-Bukhari says more than ten nights, and Banu ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf said eighteen. Ibn Kathir sets the reports side by side without settling it."
msgstr "Ibn Ishaq anataja Jumatatu hadi Alhamisi. Ripoti katika al-Bukhari inasema zaidi ya usiku kumi, na Banu ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf walisema kumi na nane. Ibn Kathir anaweka ripoti hizi kando kwa kando bila kuamua."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The first Friday, and Madinah"
msgstr "Ijumaa ya kwanza, na Madinah"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Friday · 12 Rabi‘ al-Awwal · 27 September 622"
msgstr "Ijumaa · 12 Rabi‘ al-Awwal · 27 Septemba 622"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "That it was a Friday is in the early reports. The calendar date is a modern reckoning, and it follows the four-day stay."
msgstr "Kwamba ilikuwa Ijumaa imetajwa katika ripoti za mapema. Tarehe ya kalenda ni makadirio ya kisasa, na inafuatia ukaaji wa siku nne."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Evidence shown. Each point is a cited passage, coloured by kind."
msgstr "Ushahidi umeonyeshwa. Kila nukta ni kifungu kilichonukuliwa, kikiwa na rangi kulingana na aina yake."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Evidence hidden."
msgstr "Ushahidi umefichwa."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Hide evidence on the map"
msgstr "Ficha ushahidi kwenye ramani"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Show evidence on the map"
msgstr "Onyesha ushahidi kwenye ramani"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Hide timeline"
msgstr "Ficha mpangilio wa muda"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Show timeline"
msgstr "Onyesha mpangilio wa muda"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "How each date is known"
msgstr "Jinsi kila tarehe inavyojulikana"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "<0/>Stated in the account"
msgstr "<0/>Imeelezwa katika simulizi"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "<0/>Reckoned later"
msgstr "<0/>Imekadiriwa baadaye"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "<0/>Accounts differ"
msgstr "<0/>Simulizi zinatofautiana"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "<0/>Not dated"
msgstr "<0/>Haikupigwa tarehe"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "The journey day by day · September 622"
msgstr "Safari siku hadi siku · Septemba 622"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Scrub through the days of the journey"
msgstr "Sogeza kupitia siku za safari"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Go to this stage <0/>"
msgstr "Nenda kwenye hatua hii <0/>"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "The Quran"
msgstr "Kurani"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Hadith collections"
msgstr "Mikusanyiko ya Hadithi"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Classical sirah and history"
msgstr "Sira za kale na historia"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Modern authors"
msgstr "Waandishi wa sasa"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Evidence on the map"
msgstr "Ushahidi kwenye ramani"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Each point of light is a passage this chapter cites, placed where it speaks of. Select one to read it."
msgstr "Kila nukta ya mwanga ni kifungu ambacho sura hii inanukuu, kilichowekwa pale inapozungumzia. Chagua kimoja ili ukisome."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "This is the story of the Hijrah: when the Prophet Muhammad ﷺ travelled from Makkah to Madinah, a new home."
msgstr "Hiki ni kisa cha Hijrah: wakati Mtume Muhammad ﷺ aliposafiri kutoka Makkah kwenda Madinah, maskani mapya."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Many Muslims had already gone ahead. His best friend, Abu Bakr, waited so that they could travel together."
msgstr "Waislamu wengi walikuwa wameshatangulia. Rafiki yake mkubwa, Abu Bakr, alisubiri ili waweze kusafiri pamoja."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The Prophet ﷺ and Abu Bakr hid in a cave on Mount Thawr for three nights."
msgstr "Mtume ﷺ na Abu Bakr walijificha katika pango kwenye Mlima Thawr kwa usiku mitatu."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Each night, Abu Bakr’s son ‘Abdullah came in the dark to tell them the news from Makkah."
msgstr "Kila usiku, mtoto wa Abu Bakr, ‘Abdullah, alikuja gizani kuwaletea habari kutoka Makkah."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A shepherd called ‘Amir brought his sheep close every evening, so that they had milk to drink."
msgstr "Mchungaji aliyeitwa ‘Amir alileta kondoo wake karibu kila jioni, ili wapate maziwa ya kunywa."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Abu Bakr was worried: if someone looked down, they would be seen! The Prophet ﷺ calmed him."
msgstr "Abu Bakr alikuwa na wasiwasi: ikiwa mtu angeangalia chini, wangeonekana! Mtume ﷺ alimtuliza."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The Quran remembers what the Prophet ﷺ said to his friend in the cave: do not be sad, Allah is with us."
msgstr "Quran inakumbusha kile Mtume ﷺ alichomwambia rafiki yake pangoni: usihuzunike, hakika Allah yuko pamoja nasi."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Quraysh offered a big reward to catch them. A rider called Suraqah raced after them on his horse."
msgstr "Maqurayshi waliahidi zawadi kubwa kwa yeyote atakayewakamata. Mpanda farasi aliyeitwa Suraqah aliwakimbiza kwa farasi wake."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "As he came close, his horse’s legs sank into the ground, and he fell off!"
msgstr "Alipokaribia, miguu ya farasi wake ilizama ardhini, naye akaanguka chini!"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Suraqah gave up the chase. They asked him only to keep their secret, and went on their way."
msgstr "Suraqah aliacha kuwafuata. Walimwomba tu afiche siri yao, nao wakaendelea na safari yao."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "At last they reached Madinah! The Prophet’s camel walked through the town and knelt in an open yard."
msgstr "Hatimaye walifika Madinah! Ngamia wa Mtume alitembea mjini na kupiga magoti kwenye uwanja wazi."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "That yard became the place of his mosque, and he carried bricks to help build it."
msgstr "Uwanja huo ukawa mahali pa msikiti wake, naye alibeba matofali kusaidia kuujenga."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "One hot noon, the Prophet ﷺ came to Abu Bakr’s house with big news: it was time to go. Abu Bakr asked to come too, and he said yes."
msgstr "Mchana mmoja wa jua kali, Mtume ﷺ alikuja nyumbani kwa Abu Bakr akiwa na habari kubwa: ulikuwa wakati wa kuondoka. Abu Bakr aliomba kuandamana naye, naye akakubali."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Abu Bakr took all his money for the journey. His daughter Asma put stones in its place to comfort her grandfather, who could not see."
msgstr "Abu Bakr alichukua pesa zake zote kwa ajili ya safari. Binti yake Asma aliweka mawe mahali pake ili kumfariji babu yake, ambaye alikuwa haoni."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Asma used her belt to tie up their food bag. People called her “the one with two belts”."
msgstr "Asma alitumia mshipi wake kufunga mfuko wao wa chakula. Watu walimwita \"mwenye mishipi miwili\"."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "One report says the searchers saw a spider’s web across the cave and walked away."
msgstr "Simulizi moja inasema kuwa watafutaji waliona utando wa buibui kwenye lango la pango kisha wakaondoka."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Their guide knew the desert well. He led them along the coast, past many places whose names we still know."
msgstr "Kiongozi wao alijua jangwa vizuri sana. Aliwaongoza kupitia pwani, wakipita maeneo mengi ambayo majina yake bado tunayajua hadi leo."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "On the way, a friend called al-Zubayr gave them new white clothes."
msgstr "Njiani, rafiki yao aliyeitwa al-Zubayr aliwapa nguo mpya nyeupe."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "On his way into Madinah, the Prophet ﷺ led Friday prayer with about a hundred people."
msgstr "Akiwa njiani kuingia Madinah, Mtume ﷺ aliongoza swala ya Ijumaa akiwa na takriban watu mia moja."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Everyone wanted the Prophet ﷺ to stay with them. He said: let the camel go, she has been told where to stop."
msgstr "Kila mtu alitaka Mtume ﷺ akae naye. Akasema: mwacheni ngamia aende, kwani ameelekezwa mahali pa kusimama."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "He stayed in the house of Abu Ayyub until his mosque and his home were built."
msgstr "Aliishi katika nyumba ya Abu Ayyub hadi msikiti wake na nyumba yake vilipojengwa."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "He made the people who arrived and the people of Madinah brothers, to help each other."
msgstr "Aliwafanya watu waliofika na wenyeji wa Madinah kuwa ndugu, ili wasaidiane."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Many people remember a happy song sung to welcome him, but we are not sure it was sung that day."
msgstr "Watu wengi wanakumbuka wimbo wa furaha ulioimbwa kwa ajili ya kumkaribisha, lakini hatuna hakika kama uliimbwa siku hiyo."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The Hijrah is so central that the Islamic calendar counts its years from it."
msgstr "Hijrah ni tukio muhimu sana kiasi kwamba kalenda ya Kiislamu inahesabu miaka yake kuanzia tukio hilo."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Trust and careful planning sit side by side: the Prophet ﷺ relied on Allah and still prepared every step."
msgstr "Kumtegemea Allah na kupanga mipango kwa makini huenda pamoja: Mtume ﷺ alimtegemea Allah na bado alijiandaa kwa kila hatua."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Even with people plotting against him, he made sure their property was returned. His honesty did not depend on how he was treated."
msgstr "Hata wakati watu walipokuwa wakimfanyia hila, alihakikisha kuwa amana zao zinarudishwa. Uaminifu wake haukutegemea jinsi alivyotendewa."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "In the most frightening moment, the lesson is calm trust: Allah is with us."
msgstr "Katika wakati wa kutisha zaidi, somo kubwa ni utulivu wa kumtegemea Allah: Hakika Allah yuko pamoja nasi."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Choosing an unexpected route was wisdom, not doubt. Muslims are taught to trust Allah and still take sensible steps."
msgstr "Kuchagua njia isiyotarajiwa ilikuwa ni hekima, si shaka. Waislamu wanafundishwa kumtegemea Allah na bado kuchukua hatua za busara."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A man who set out to capture them left asking for their protection. The story is full of reversals like this."
msgstr "Mtu mmoja aliyeondoka kwenda kuwakamata alirudi akiomba ulinzi wao. Historia imejaa mabadiliko makubwa kama haya."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Hospitality from strangers, and blessing in very little, run through the whole of the Prophet’s life."
msgstr "Kukaribishwa vizuri na wageni, na baraka katika kitu kidogo sana, vimejitokeza katika maisha yote ya Mtume."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Short for “peace and blessings of Allah be upon him”, said by Muslims after the Prophet’s name."
msgstr "Kifupi cha \"amani na baraka za Allah ziwe juu yake\", kinachosemwa na Waislamu baada ya kutaja jina la Mtume."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Hijrah"
msgstr "Hijrah"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The migration of the Prophet ﷺ and his companions from Makkah to Madinah, in 622."
msgstr "Uhamiaji wa Mtume ﷺ na maswahaba zake kutoka Makkah kwenda Madinah, mnamo mwaka 622."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Quraysh"
msgstr "Quraysh"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The leading tribe of Makkah. The Prophet ﷺ himself belonged to it."
msgstr "Kabila kuu la Makkah. Mtume ﷺ mwenyewe alitokana na kabila hili."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The city where the Prophet ﷺ was born, home of the Ka‘bah."
msgstr "Mji aliozaliwa Mtume ﷺ, nyumbani kwa Ka‘bah."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Then called Yathrib: the city that welcomed the Prophet ﷺ. Its name means “the city”."
msgstr "Hapo awali uliitwa Yathrib: mji uliomkaribisha Mtume ﷺ. Jina lake linamaanisha \"mji\"."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Abu Bakr"
msgstr "Abu Bakr"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The Prophet’s closest friend and companion, who later led the Muslims after him."
msgstr "Rafiki na mwandani wa karibu wa Mtume, ambaye baadaye aliwaongoza Waislamu baada yake."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Allah"
msgstr "Allah"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The Arabic word for God."
msgstr "Neno la Kiarabu linalomaanisha Mungu."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The holy book of Islam, which Muslims believe is the word of Allah."
msgstr "Kitabu kitukufu cha Uislamu, ambacho Waislamu wanaamini kuwa ni neno la Allah."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The collection of hadith that Muslims consider the most reliable."
msgstr "Mkusanyiko wa hadithi ambao Waislamu wanauona kuwa wa kuaminika zaidi."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Kathir"
msgstr "Ibn Kathir"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A scholar of the fourteenth century whose history of the Prophet’s life is widely used."
msgstr "Mwanachuoni wa karne ya kumi na nne ambaye kitabu chake cha historia ya maisha ya Mtume kinatumiwa sana."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Ishaq"
msgstr "Ibn Ishaq"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Thawr"
msgstr "Thawr"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A mountain south of Makkah, with a small cave near its top."
msgstr "Mlima ulioko kusini mwa Makkah, wenye pango dogo karibu na kilele chake."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A village on the edge of Madinah, where the Prophet ﷺ stopped first."
msgstr "Kijiji kilichoko pembezoni mwa Madinah, ambapo Mtume ﷺ alisimama kwanza."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A passage of the Quran, the holy book of Islam."
msgstr "Aya ya Quran, kitabu kitukufu cha Uislamu."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A hadith: a report of the Prophet’s words or deeds, passed on through named narrators. The collections of al-Bukhari and Muslim are considered the most reliable."
msgstr "Hadithi: ripoti ya maneno au vitendo vya Mtume, iliyopokelewa kupitia wasimulizi waliotajwa majina. Mikusanyiko ya al-Bukhari na Muslim inachukuliwa kuwa ya kuaminika zaidi."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A report from the early histories of the Prophet’s life. They gather many accounts, some stronger than others."
msgstr "Ripoti kutoka katika historia za mapema za maisha ya Mtume. Zinakusanya masimulizi mengi, baadhi yakiwa na nguvu zaidi kuliko mengine."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A modern author’s explanation or calculation, built on the early sources."
msgstr "Ufafanuzi au hesabu ya mwandishi wa sasa, iliyojengwa juu ya vyanzo vya mapema."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Young learners"
msgstr "Wanafunzi wadogo"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "New to the story"
msgstr "Mgeni kwenye kisa hiki"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "In depth"
msgstr "Kwa kina"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Mfumo"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "How would you like to follow the journey?"
msgstr "Je, ungependa kufuatilia safari hii vipi?"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Six short stages, in simple words."
msgstr "Hatua sita fupi, kwa maneno rahisi."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Terms explained, and why each stage matters."
msgstr "Ufafanuzi wa istilahi, na umuhimu wa kila hatua."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Every detail, with the evidence and the timeline open."
msgstr "Kila undani, pamoja na ushahidi na mstari wa muda wazi."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Why this matters:"
msgstr "Kwa nini hili ni muhimu:"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Terms"
msgstr "Istilahi"

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Abu Bakr prepared two camels. Asma helped pack food for the journey."
msgstr "Abu Bakr alitayarisha ngamia wawili. Asma alisaidia kufungasha chakula cha safari."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "They chose a guide who knew the roads well. He would bring their camels after three nights."
msgstr "Walichagua kiongozi wa njia aliyejua njia vizuri. Angewaletea ngamia wao baada ya masiku matatu."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "An early account tells how the leaders of Quraysh met in Makkah to plan against the Prophet ﷺ."
msgstr "Simulizi la mapema linaeleza jinsi viongozi wa Maquraishi walivyokutana Makkah kupanga njama dhidi ya Mtume ﷺ."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "The account says they waited outside his door that night, while ‘Ali slept in his bed, wrapped in his green cloak."
msgstr "Simulizi hilo linasema walingoja nje ya mlango wake usiku huo, huku ‘Ali akilala kitandani mwake, akiwa amejifunika vazi lake la kijani."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "After three nights, their guide brought the camels. They left the cave and travelled towards Madinah."
msgstr "Baada ya masiku matatu, kiongozi wao wa njia alileta ngamia. Waliondoka pangoni na kusafiri kuelekea Madinah."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "They took a route near the coast. The journey was long, with many stops along the way."
msgstr "Walipita njia iliyo karibu na pwani. Safari ilikuwa ndefu, kukiwa na vituo vingi njiani."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Another account describes a stop at Umm Ma‘bad’s tent. She had a thin sheep that was not giving milk."
msgstr "Simulizi jingine linaeleza kuhusu kituo kwenye hema la Umm Ma‘bad. Alikuwa na kondoo aliyekonda ambaye hakuwa akitoa maziwa."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "It says the Prophet ﷺ prayed and milked the sheep, and there was milk for everyone."
msgstr "Linasema Mtume ﷺ aliomba na kumkama kondoo huyo, na kukawa na maziwa kwa kila mtu."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "They first stopped at Quba, near Madinah, where a mosque was founded."
msgstr "Kwanza walisimama Quba, karibu na Madinah, ambapo msikiti ulianzishwa."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Madinah is to the north. They went south first, towards Mount Thawr."
msgstr "Madinah ipo kaskazini. Walianza kuelekea kusini, kuelekea Mlima Thawr."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "A mosque was founded at Quba, making worship a part of life in the new home."
msgstr "Msikiti ulianzishwa huko Quba, na kuifanya ibada kuwa sehemu ya maisha katika makazi mapya."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Madinah became a home for the growing Muslim community, bringing newcomers and their hosts together."
msgstr "Madinah ikawa makazi ya jamii ya Waislamu iliyokuwa ikikua, ikiwaleta pamoja wageni na wenyeji wao."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "An eighth-century historian whose accounts of the Prophet’s life are preserved by later writers."
msgstr "Mwanahistoria wa karne ya nane ambaye masimulizi yake kuhusu maisha ya Mtume yamehifadhiwa na waandishi wa baadaye."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "Mode changed. Your place is saved."
msgstr "Hali imebadilishwa. Mahali pako pamehifadhiwa."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "‘Ali stayed behind to return the precious things that people had left with the Prophet ﷺ."
msgstr "‘Ali alibaki nyuma ili kurudisha vitu vya thamani ambavyo watu walikuwa wamemwachia Mtume ﷺ."

